#: src/configpage.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\"GitHub\" uses GitHub's own colors. \"Match editor / system theme\" "
"recolors the same layout from the active editor theme, so the preview blends "
"with the rest of Kate."
msgstr ""
"\"GitHub\" aukerak GitHub-en berezko koloreak erabiltzen ditu. \"Bat etorri "
"editorearen / sistemaren gaiarekin\" aukerak diseinu bera editorearen gai "
"aktiboaren arabera koloreztatzen du, aurreikuspegia Kate-ren gainerakoarekin "
"bat etor dadin."

#: src/configpage.cpp:97 src/previewwidget.cpp:180
#, kde-format
msgid "Load media previews from remote URLs"
msgstr "Zamatu multimedia urruneko URLetatik"

#: src/configpage.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Off by default so the preview stays fully offline. Enable to let images load "
"over http(s)."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez desgaituta, aurreikuspegia erabat lerroz kanpo egon dadin. "
"Gaitu irudiak http(s) bidez zamatzen uzteko."

#: src/configpage.cpp:105
#, kde-format
msgid "Math macros:"
msgstr "Matematikako makroak:"

#: src/configpage.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \\newcommand lines written here are available in the formulas of every "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Hemen idatzitako \\newcommand lerroak dokumentu guztietako formuletan "
"erabilgarri daude."

